  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "We are E.A.T.I. -- Experimental Alien Technology Institution. We are a collective group posting our most confusing and interesting cases in \"audio drama\" format as a horror podcast.&nbsp; From dimensions, to unexplainable experiments, to a strange cult, to cosmic horror. These found footage cases will leave you confused, disturbed, and wanting more as each \"standalone\" episode has an underlying story. Can you find the dots and connect each episode? Or will you get lost and lose yourself to the footage presented?",
